      "originalText": "LOCAL DEV PORTS   \u2014   web :3000   \u00b7   API :3001   \u00b7   Postgres :5432   \u00b7   Redis :6379   \u00b7   langfuse remapped 3000 \u2192 3010 (was colliding with web)",
