      "height": 15.0,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Root cause of breakage: API CORS was pinned to :3000; langfuse squatted :3000, pushing web to another port \u2192 every tRPC/WS call blocked (login = Clerk, exempt). Now fixed at both layers.",
